OL,3,GNEWSAWalker rescued after 100ft fall in
OL,4,AGlen Coe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hillwalker has been rescued after
OL,7,Ffalling 100ft (30m) down a gorge in the
OL,8,FCoire Gabhail area of Glen Coe.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland called in a team from
OL,11,FGlencoe Mountain Rescue after reports
OL,12,Fof the incident on Friday.
OL,14,FA Coastguard Rescue helicopter from
OL,15,FInverness attended the scene, though
OL,16,Fmembers of the rescue team used ropes
OL,17,Fto bring the walker out of the gorge.
OL,19,FThe person was eventually able to leave
OL,20,Fthe scene on foot.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
